====== TP-Link TL-WDR4300 (N750) ======
TP-Link TL-WDR4300 has 802.11n Dual Band (concurrent) WiFi and Gigabit Ethernet.
Advertised as 750 Mbps it is Dual-Stream (2x2) on the 2.4 GHz Band and Triple-Stream (3x3) on the 5 GHz Band. Same as the TL-WDR4310. 

Related to TL-WDR3600, which has only two instead of three antennas.

{{:media:tplink:tl-wdr4300:tl-wdr4300_v1.jpg?400|}}

