eth0: ba:be:fa:ce:08:41
athrs17_reg_init: complete
eth0 up
eth0
Autobooting in 1 seconds
</code>

   - in case you failed the right timing just reboot again until the prompt appears

<code>
db12x>
</code>

   - now lets check what kind of parameters the u-boot loader expects (e.g file name of firmware via TFPT & Load Adress)
   - type ''tftpboot'' & press ENTER ...

<code>
db12x> tftpboot

dup 1 speed 1000
